//	Issues:  Template paths must exist | Skill names must match
//
// # X.2 Policy [POLICY]
//
//	Safe:    Add insights, update template paths, add new file types
//	Careful: Change workflow steps (affects all file creation)
//	Never:   Break 3-block structure, remove core insights
//
//	Future:  planned: Integration with validation tools
//	         considered: Auto-verification after file creation
